 "summary": {
  "en": "Lagrangian urban air parcel from 06:00 for 24 h (after the PartMC urban-plume case): background Aitken and accumulation modes, diesel, gasoline and cooking emissions for 12 h, dilution with background air, photochemical production of sulfuric acid, nitric acid and SOA vapours following J_NO2. BC-containing particles age from fresh to coated.",
  "zh": "仿照 PartMC urban plume 的拉格朗日城市气团，06:00 起 24 小时：背景 Aitken 与积聚模态，柴油车、汽油车与烹饪排放持续 12 小时，与背景空气稀释混合，硫酸、硝酸与 SOA 前体按 J_NO2 光化学生成。含 BC 颗粒由新鲜逐步被包覆老化。"
 },
