  "SCRAM has no gas-phase chemistry: the condensable vapours are prescribed sources scaled by J_NO2/max(J_NO2) (noon rates SULF 0.9, HNO3 1.8, SOA vapours 1.1 ug/m3/h).",
  "Dilution 1.5e-5 1/s towards the initial (background) state."
